name conversation_jitter_50ms
describe User <-> AI conversation, audio, 100 ms RTT, 50 ms jitter each way (#757)
call two-way
video off
duration 30s
at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=50ms jitter=50ms queue=300ms
reverse at 0s capacity=2500kbps delay=50ms jitter=50ms queue=300ms
turn user 1s-4s
turn ai after=800ms len=4s
turn user 10s-13s
turn ai after=800ms len=4s
turn user 19s-22s
turn ai after=800ms len=4s
# program.md 6.3, conversation rows: every reply heard (sev:1), at most 500 ms added on a 100 ms RTT link (sev:2).
expect conv.responses == 3
expect conv.response_delay_p95_ms < 500
